    {"id":"02-early-start","label":"Pre-dawn inflation","visual":{"path":"assets/source/pexels-flight.mp4","type":"video","source_start":0,"motion":"none","source_id":"media-pexels-flight"},"narration":[{"id":"02a","text":"ツアーは日の出前。季節によっては午前4時ごろに起き、ホテル送迎で受付や軽食へ向かいます。"}]},
