    {"id":"04-flight-time","label":"Balloons over valley","visual":{"path":"assets/source/cappadocia-4k.webm","type":"video","source_start":9,"motion":"none","source_id":"media-commons-cappadocia"},"narration":[{"id":"04a","text":"標準プランの飛行はおよそ1時間。谷すれすれから高い眺望まで、風に乗って静かに進みます。"}]},
    {"id":"05-basket-size","label":"Basket and flight options","visual":{"path":"assets/selected/balloons-dawn.jpg","type":"image","motion":"zoom_out","source_id":"media-balloon-dawn"},"narration":[{"id":"05a","text":"一般的なバスケットは14人から20人ほど。少人数や長時間のプランほど、ゆとりは増えます。"}]},
    {"id":"06-flight-control","label":"Official flight assessment","visual":{"path":"assets/source/cappadocia-4k.webm","type":"video","source_start":17,"motion":"none","source_id":"media-commons-cappadocia"},"narration":[{"id":"06a","text":"ただし運航は、風や視界を見た公式の適否判断と、パイロットの安全判断が最優先です。"}]},
    {"id":"07-checklist","label":"Booking checklist","visual":{"path":"graphics/checklist.mp4","type":"video","motion":"none","source_id":"graphic-checklist"},"narration":[{"id":"07a","text":"予約では、認可事業者か、飛行時間と人数、送迎、保険、欠航時の振替と返金条件を確認しましょう。"}]},
    {"id":"08-first-morning","label":"Backup day","visual":{"path":"assets/source/pexels-flight.mp4","type":"video","source_start":4,"motion":"none","source_id":"media-pexels-flight"},"narration":[{"id":"08a","text":"いちばん大事なコツは、滞在最初の朝に予約すること。欠航でも次の朝へ振り替える余地が残ります。"}]},
    {"id":"09-price","label":"Compare conditions not headline price","visual":{"path":"assets/source/cappadocia-4k.webm","type":"video","source_start":5,"motion":"none","source_id":"media-commons-cappadocia"},"narration":[{"id":"09a","text":"料金は季節と空席で変わります。最安値だけでなく、人数と飛行時間を同じ条件で比べてください。"}]},
    {"id":"10-clothing","label":"Clothing at sunrise","visual":{"path":"assets/selected/balloon-sunrise.jpg","type":"image","motion":"zoom_in","source_id":"media-balloon-sunrise"},"narration":[{"id":"10a","text":"服装は、冷え込む夜明けに備えた重ね着と、平らで歩きやすい靴。両手を空けられる荷物が安心です。"}]},
